# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization
* text=auto

# The Work section's language column is read from GitHub's language bar at
# build time (src/lib/github.ts), and that bar counts bytes. content.ts is a
# large copy deck and the build-time fetch modules add more, which together
# pushed this repo's label off "Astro" and onto "TypeScript". Excluding .ts
# from the count pins it back to the framework, which is the more useful
# thing for that row to say. Delete this line to let the real byte counts win.
*.ts linguist-detectable=false
